    "section_pdp_faq": {
      "type": "section",
      "name": "FAQ",
      "blocks": {
        "faq_heading": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<h2><strong>Frequently asked questions</strong></h2>",
            "width": "100%",
            "max_width": "normal",
            "alignment": "center",
            "type_preset": "h4",
            "font": "var(--font-body--family)",
            "font_size": "1rem",
            "line_height": "normal",
            "letter_spacing": "normal",
            "case": "none",
            "wrap": "pretty",
            "color": "var(--color-foreground-heading)",
            "background": false,
            "background_color": "#00000026",
            "corner_radius": 0,
            "padding-block-start": 0,
            "padding-block-end": 0,
            "padding-inline-start": 0,
            "padding-inline-end": 0
          },
          "blocks": {},
          "name": "t:names.heading"
        },
        "faq_accordion": {
          "type": "accordion",
          "settings": {
            "icon": "plus",
            "dividers": true,
            "type_preset": "h6",
            "inherit_color_scheme": true,
            "color_scheme": "",
            "border": "none",
            "border_width": 1,
            "border_opacity": 100,
            "border_radius": 0,
            "padding-block-start": 0,
            "padding-block-end": 0,
            "padding-inline-start": 0,
            "padding-inline-end": 0
          },
          "blocks": {
            "faq_wrinkle": {
              "type": "_accordion-row",
              "settings": {
                "heading": "Will my clothes come out wrinkled?",
                "icon": "none"
              },
              "blocks": {
                "faq_wrinkle_t": {
                  "type": "text",
                  "settings": {
                    "text": "<p>Compression presses clothes flat rather than crumpling them, so jeans, knits, and casual wear come out fine. Fold delicate shirts on top of the stack and give them a quick shake-out when you arrive.</p>",
                    "width": "100%",
                    "max_width": "normal",
                    "alignment": "left",
                    "type_preset": "rte",
                    "font": "var(--font-body--family)",
                    "font_size": "0.875rem",
                    "line_height": "normal",
                    "letter_spacing": "normal",
                    "case": "none",
                    "wrap": "pretty",
                    "color": "var(--color-foreground)",
                    "background": false,
                    "background_color": "#00000026",
                    "corner_radius": 0,
                    "padding-block-start": 0,
                    "padding-block-end": 0,
                    "padding-inline-start": 0,
                    "padding-inline-end": 0
                  },
                  "blocks": {}
                }
              },
              "block_order": [
                "faq_wrinkle_t"
              ]
            },
            "faq_weight": {
              "type": "_accordion-row",
              "settings": {
                "heading": "Does this help with airline weight limits?",
                "icon": "none"
              },
              "blocks": {
                "faq_weight_t": {
                  "type": "text",
                  "settings": {
                    "text": "<p>Honestly, no. Compression saves space, not weight: a compressed bag weighs exactly what its contents weigh. What it changes is whether everything fits in a carry-on at all, and that is what removes the checked-bag fee. If you are fighting a weight limit rather than a size limit, the answer is to pack less.</p>",
                    "width": "100%",
                    "max_width": "normal",
                    "alignment": "left",
                    "type_preset": "rte",
                    "font": "var(--font-body--family)",
                    "font_size": "0.875rem",
                    "line_height": "normal",
                    "letter_spacing": "normal",
                    "case": "none",
                    "wrap": "pretty",
                    "color": "var(--color-foreground)",
                    "background": false,
                    "background_color": "#00000026",
                    "corner_radius": 0,
                    "padding-block-start": 0,
                    "padding-block-end": 0,
                    "padding-inline-start": 0,
                    "padding-inline-end": 0
                  },
                  "blocks": {}
                }
              },
              "block_order": [
                "faq_weight_t"
              ]
            },
            "faq_security": {
              "type": "_accordion-row",
              "settings": {
                "heading": "Will airport security have a problem with a sealed bag?",
                "icon": "none"
              },
              "blocks": {
                "faq_security_t": {
                  "type": "text",
                  "settings": {
                    "text": "<p>Compression bags are allowed in both carry-on and checked luggage. A screener may still open your case and unzip a bag for a closer look, which happens with any densely packed item. If they do, the pump is right there with you, so re-compressing takes seconds.</p>",
                    "width": "100%",
                    "max_width": "normal",
                    "alignment": "left",
                    "type_preset": "rte",
                    "font": "var(--font-body--family)",
                    "font_size": "0.875rem",
                    "line_height": "normal",
                    "letter_spacing": "normal",
                    "case": "none",
                    "wrap": "pretty",
                    "color": "var(--color-foreground)",
                    "background": false,
                    "background_color": "#00000026",
                    "corner_radius": 0,
                    "padding-block-start": 0,
                    "padding-block-end": 0,
                    "padding-inline-start": 0,
                    "padding-inline-end": 0
                  },
                  "blocks": {}
                }
              },
              "block_order": [
                "faq_security_t"
              ]
            },
            "faq_fit": {
              "type": "_accordion-row",
              "settings": {
                "heading": "Will the compressed bag fit in my carry-on?",
                "icon": "none"
              },
              "blocks": {
                "faq_fit_t": {
                  "type": "text",
                  "settings": {
                    "text": "<p>Yes. Each bag measures 18.5\" &times; 11.8\" &times; 5.9\" and compresses down to roughly 3\" thick, sized for standard carry-ons and backpacks. Your suitcase still needs to meet your airline's size rules; Voltairs just makes sure everything fits inside it.</p>",
                    "width": "100%",
                    "max_width": "normal",
                    "alignment": "left",
                    "type_preset": "rte",
                    "font": "var(--font-body--family)",
                    "font_size": "0.875rem",
                    "line_height": "normal",
                    "letter_spacing": "normal",
                    "case": "none",
                    "wrap": "pretty",
                    "color": "var(--color-foreground)",
                    "background": false,
                    "background_color": "#00000026",
                    "corner_radius": 0,
                    "padding-block-start": 0,
                    "padding-block-end": 0,
                    "padding-inline-start": 0,
                    "padding-inline-end": 0
                  },
                  "blocks": {}
                }
              },
              "block_order": [
                "faq_fit_t"
              ]
            },
            "faq_sixty": {
              "type": "_accordion-row",
              "settings": {
                "heading": "Is it guaranteed to shrink my clothes by 60%?",
                "icon": "none"
              },
              "blocks": {
                "faq_sixty_t": {
                  "type": "text",
                  "settings": {
                    "text": "<p>Honestly, no. Up to 60% is the maximum we measured, and the result depends on the fabric. Fluffy items that trap air, like sweaters, hoodies, and jackets, compress the most. Dense fabrics like denim compress less. Most mixed loads still shrink far beyond what rolling or packing cubes can do.</p>",
                    "width": "100%",
                    "max_width": "normal",
                    "alignment": "left",
                    "type_preset": "rte",
                    "font": "var(--font-body--family)",
                    "font_size": "0.875rem",
                    "line_height": "normal",
                    "letter_spacing": "normal",
                    "case": "none",
                    "wrap": "pretty",
                    "color": "var(--color-foreground)",
                    "background": false,
                    "background_color": "#00000026",
                    "corner_radius": 0,
                    "padding-block-start": 0,
                    "padding-block-end": 0,
                    "padding-inline-start": 0,
                    "padding-inline-end": 0
                  },
                  "blocks": {}
                }
              },
              "block_order": [
                "faq_sixty_t"
              ]
            },
            "faq_pump": {
              "type": "_accordion-row",
              "settings": {
                "heading": "Does the pump need batteries?",
                "icon": "none"
              },
              "blocks": {
                "faq_pump_t": {
                  "type": "text",
                  "settings": {
                    "text": "<p>No. The 30W pump is USB-C rechargeable and doubles as an LED light. It deflates a full bag in seconds, and with the included nozzles it inflates air mattresses and pool floats too.</p>",
                    "width": "100%",
                    "max_width": "normal",
                    "alignment": "left",
                    "type_preset": "rte",
                    "font": "var(--font-body--family)",
                    "font_size": "0.875rem",
                    "line_height": "normal",
                    "letter_spacing": "normal",
                    "case": "none",
                    "wrap": "pretty",
                    "color": "var(--color-foreground)",
                    "background": false,
                    "background_color": "#00000026",
                    "corner_radius": 0,
                    "padding-block-start": 0,
                    "padding-block-end": 0,
                    "padding-inline-start": 0,
                    "padding-inline-end": 0
                  },
                  "blocks": {}
                }
              },
              "block_order": [
                "faq_pump_t"
              ]
            },
            "faq_howto": {
              "type": "_accordion-row",
              "settings": {
                "heading": "How do I use it?",
                "icon": "none"
              },
              "blocks": {
                "faq_howto_t": {
                  "type": "text",
                  "settings": {
                    "text": "<p>Pack the bag, zip it shut, hold the pump against the valve, and wait a few seconds. That is the whole process, and the three steps above cover it. If anything is unclear once your kit arrives, email info@voltairs.com and a human will walk you through it.</p>",
                    "width": "100%",
                    "max_width": "normal",
                    "alignment": "left",
                    "type_preset": "rte",
                    "font": "var(--font-body--family)",
                    "font_size": "0.875rem",
                    "line_height": "normal",
                    "letter_spacing": "normal",
                    "case": "none",
                    "wrap": "pretty",
                    "color": "var(--color-foreground)",
                    "background": false,
                    "background_color": "#00000026",
                    "corner_radius": 0,
                    "padding-block-start": 0,
                    "padding-block-end": 0,
                    "padding-inline-start": 0,
                    "padding-inline-end": 0
                  },
                  "blocks": {}
                }
              },
              "block_order": [
                "faq_howto_t"
              ]
            },
            "faq_capacity": {
              "type": "_accordion-row",
              "settings": {
                "heading": "How much actually fits in one bag?",
                "icon": "none"
              },
              "blocks": {
                "faq_capacity_t": {
                  "type": "text",
                  "settings": {
                    "text": "<p>Up to 22 lb of clothing per bag, roughly 8 to 10 days of outfits once compressed to about 40% of their original size. The kit includes two bags.</p>",
                    "width": "100%",
                    "max_width": "normal",
                    "alignment": "left",
                    "type_preset": "rte",
                    "font": "var(--font-body--family)",
                    "font_size": "0.875rem",
                    "line_height": "normal",
                    "letter_spacing": "normal",
                    "case": "none",
                    "wrap": "pretty",
                    "color": "var(--color-foreground)",
                    "background": false,
                    "background_color": "#00000026",
                    "corner_radius": 0,
                    "padding-block-start": 0,
                    "padding-block-end": 0,
                    "padding-inline-start": 0,
                    "padding-inline-end": 0
                  },
                  "blocks": {}
                }
              },
              "block_order": [
                "faq_capacity_t"
              ]
            },
            "faq_guarantee": {
              "type": "_accordion-row",
              "settings": {
                "heading": "What if it doesn't work for me?",
                "icon": "none"
              },
              "blocks": {
                "faq_guarantee_t": {
                  "type": "text",
                  "settings": {
                    "text": "<p>Every kit comes with a 100-day money-back guarantee, counted from the day it is delivered. Take it on a real trip. If it does not save you the space and the fees, email info@voltairs.com and return it for a full refund. Kits bought with a discount are covered too.</p>",
                    "width": "100%",
                    "max_width": "normal",
                    "alignment": "left",
                    "type_preset": "rte",
                    "font": "var(--font-body--family)",
                    "font_size": "0.875rem",
                    "line_height": "normal",
                    "letter_spacing": "normal",
                    "case": "none",
                    "wrap": "pretty",
                    "color": "var(--color-foreground)",
                    "background": false,
                    "background_color": "#00000026",
                    "corner_radius": 0,
                    "padding-block-start": 0,
                    "padding-block-end": 0,
                    "padding-inline-start": 0,
                    "padding-inline-end": 0
                  },
                  "blocks": {}
                }
              },
              "block_order": [
                "faq_guarantee_t"
              ]
            },
            "faq_delivery": {
              "type": "_accordion-row",
              "settings": {
                "heading": "When will I get my order?",
                "icon": "none"
              },
              "blocks": {
                "faq_delivery_t": {
                  "type": "text",
                  "settings": {
                    "text": "<p>Orders ship within 2 business days. Delivery typically takes 6 to 10 business days in the US, and you will receive a tracking email as soon as it is on the way. Shipping is free within the United States.</p>",
                    "width": "100%",
                    "max_width": "normal",
                    "alignment": "left",
                    "type_preset": "rte",
                    "font": "var(--font-body--family)",
                    "font_size": "0.875rem",
                    "line_height": "normal",
                    "letter_spacing": "normal",
                    "case": "none",
                    "wrap": "pretty",
                    "color": "var(--color-foreground)",
                    "background": false,
                    "background_color": "#00000026",
                    "corner_radius": 0,
                    "padding-block-start": 0,
                    "padding-block-end": 0,
                    "padding-inline-start": 0,
                    "padding-inline-end": 0
                  },
                  "blocks": {}
                }
              },
              "block_order": [
                "faq_delivery_t"
              ]
            }
          },
